                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For a first game from an small dev, it's a pretty swell point-and-click adventure. Takes about 5 to 6 hours to complete. The puzzles made sense - I only got stuck a few times due to missing an item or conversation earlier. I enjoyed learning the lore and how the bad guys were portrayed. The item combining system was a bit of a hassle to use.\n\nPROS\npuzzles\nlore\nmusic\n\nNEUTRAL\nthat RPG Maker look\n\nCONS\nlack of proof-reading (will probably be fixed in a future update)\nsome bugs (ditto)\nitem combining could use some fine-tuning\n\nAll in all, I consider it money well spent, and look forward to seeing what One Bit Studio will do next.",
